<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608668716" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593838664 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Jul 2020 04:57</span></p>
